                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "884e06ec-8b0e-3dbd-9c20-b30a72320537",
                        "entry_id": "d629a50e-09b6-3812-b7be-c92e7a55d5a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Partisan de l’écofascisme."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86c81975-a173-4873-99d2-61ac953bb339",
                                "sense_id": "884e06ec-8b0e-3dbd-9c20-b30a72320537",
                                "text": "Pour les écofascistes le paramètre déterminant de la crise est le paramètre démographique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2e2a329a-b788-4d01-a4e7-57e92d0d1db2",
                                "sense_id": "884e06ec-8b0e-3dbd-9c20-b30a72320537",
                                "text": "Pour y résister, les écofascistes pensent qu’il va falloir accaparer et protéger les rares territoires où les« populations de souche » pourraient encore vivre, et lutter contre « les hordes de migrants » qui fuient les autres continents devenus inhospitaliers."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "47e4a1b9-fb5b-4b84-9feb-2668be4ea73f",
                        "source_entry_id": "d629a50e-09b6-3812-b7be-c92e7a55d5a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "884e06ec-8b0e-3dbd-9c20-b30a72320537",
                        "target_lang_word": "ecofascist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ecofascist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ae1e880-eaf1-36cd-b454-4bb9d7d11c60",
                                        "entry_id": "8e8825f9-4031-3707-af06-f8b179ac9a85",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A proponent of ecofascism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0546148e-d0d2-4843-936c-4dd1d06ba5d0",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae1e880-eaf1-36cd-b454-4bb9d7d11c60",
                                                "text": "Mr. Bookchin, in turn, called deep ecologists \"eco-fascists,\" partly because they wanted to limit the population radically."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be7913b5-ede9-490d-b08e-3a88210c77d2",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae1e880-eaf1-36cd-b454-4bb9d7d11c60",
                                                "text": "This brand of environmentalism only emboldens ecofascists who rightly claim that shopping green can never stop the ecological crisis. And yet, ecofascists are wrong to suggest that the suspension of democracy is the only alternative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1918a4c6-9f4c-4daa-9a63-7b2d126eb998",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae1e880-eaf1-36cd-b454-4bb9d7d11c60",
                                                "text": "A week prior, on an Instagram account reportedly linked to the alleged Gilroy, California, garlic festival shooter, he complained about migrant-driven sprawl. Months before, the Christchurch, New Zealand, shooter called himself an “eco-fascist”."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f658f698-e0c2-4ff9-8245-b9f4e38dce9a",
                                                "sense_id": "3ae1e880-eaf1-36cd-b454-4bb9d7d11c60",
                                                "text": "Modern eco-fascists still draw on the same Romantic contrast between the sublime hierarchies of nature and the supposedly effete degeneracy of modernity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "ecofascist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9a6163ff-133a-3cdd-83e8-9f99fe184d69",
                                        "entry_id": "3bc28787-893c-3ddb-b2de-851408f61cad",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to ecofascism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2547bca3-a9d1-4b4d-ac9a-e0bcd93e6cf6",
                                                "sense_id": "9a6163ff-133a-3cdd-83e8-9f99fe184d69",
                                                "text": "Representatives of this line of thought around the world are, in many cases, echoing eco-fascist ideas that themselves are rooted in an earlier age of blood-and-soil nationalism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
